sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Student
    participant B as Board (React Flow nodes)
    participant R as domain/plan reducer
    participant E1 as useRuleCheckSync
    participant E2 as useRecommendationRequests
    participant E3 as usePlannerPersistence
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant D as Dashboard / banners

    S->>B: drop or move a card, press a button
    B->>R: dispatch action (a placement writes through at once, a drag commits on the next render)
    R-->>R: next state, lastChange = diff + id (changeCounter+1)
    par immediately, on lastChange
        E1->>API: POST /rulecheck (planned, done, change, focus, limits)
        E2->>API: POST /recommendations (planned, done, parked)
    and after 500 ms of quiet
        E3->>API: PUT /planner-state (whole document)
    end
    API-->>E1: ok, message, stats, missing, errors
    Note over E1: acted on only if change.id is still the newest for this programme
    alt ok = false (a hard rule)
        E1->>D: sticky red banner for 5 s, message names action, course, semester
        E1->>B: roll back added, moved or toggled (meta.silent, no new change)
    else ok = true
        E1->>D: stats to KPIs and sections, soft warnings, missing list, green confirmation fades
    end
    API-->>E2: recommendations (dropped if a newer request exists)
    E2->>D: Recommendation Panel list
